  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together pomegranate molasses, lemon juice, garlic, oregano, cumin, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add lamb cubes to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "Thread lamb cubes onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "Brush kebabs with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "Grill kebabs for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
